Error [jet.InvalidStatement]: Expected a call, binding, assignment, or `return`, found a number
  --> tests/ui/prep_value_unclosed.jet:4:15
    |
  4 | LIMIT: #run { 4
    |               ^
 Why: Inside a function body, write a call, binding, assignment, or `return`
 Fix: e.g. print("hello") or x: 1
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003

Error [jet.UnclosedDelimiter]: `{` opened on line 4 is never closed
  --> tests/ui/prep_value_unclosed.jet:4:13
    |
  4 | LIMIT: #run { 4
    |             ^
  --> tests/ui/prep_value_unclosed.jet:4:16
    |
  4 | LIMIT: #run { 4
    |                ^ the binding `WIDTH` comes before the closing `}`
 Why: Every `{` needs a matching `}`, but the binding `WIDTH` came first
 Fix: Add `}` where the prepared value ends
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0083
